These .proto files are containerd's API, copied unchanged from
https://github.com/containerd/containerd at tag v2.4.1 (directory api/),
fetched on 2026-10-01 from
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/containerd/containerd/v2.4.1/api/<path>.

