Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0); each file keeps
its own license header where upstream has one.

Only the services and types grund's runtime uses are here: containers,
content, images, snapshots, tasks, transfer and version, with the types
they import (descriptor, metrics, mount, platform, task, transfer's
registry and imagestore, runc's options). To update, fetch the same paths
at the new tag and rebuild.
